  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who may be unfamiliar with or dismissive of the gravity of the Holocaust, potentially including those who hold antisemitic views or are susceptible to Holocaust minimization tropes. The meme is designed to provoke shock and ridicule by juxtaposing the visual of Adolf Hitler with the trivializing text, aiming to elicit a reaction from viewers who might not fully grasp the historical horror, thereby normalizing or trivializing genocide. The intent is to target communities that may be exposed to or propagate hate speech, misinformation, or historical distortion, particularly those who engage with or share content that minimizes atrocities.",
